                <pb facs="0292" n="210" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg210"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 20437/96.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-06-06"><hi rendition="#italic">June 6,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Answering your June 1. Apparently impossible to procure repeal of potash law,
                    passed with full knowledge of our views. I suggest immediate request for most
                    favorable conditions obtainable from Bundesrat under section 46.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
